B.Km=new A.dK("2","Fintech Unicorn","Product Designer",1.5,30,"Silent Layoff / Role Elimination","Entire design division was called into an unexpected 9:30 AM Google Meet. HR gave 30 days severance. No warning, stellar performance reviews prior.","Immediately reached out to my alumni network. I am now at a Series-B startup and have 3 open referrals for product designers and UI engineers\u2014feel free to reach out!",35,!0,!0,!0,530,215,19,"4h ago",'9:15 AM Calendar Invite: "Quick 10-Min Sync (HR + VP Product) - Attendance Mandatory"','9:25 AM: "Slack deactivated mid-sentence. Exported my Figma portfolio the night before after seeing the signs."',30)
B.Kn=new A.dK("1","TCS","SDE-2 (Cloud Engineering)",2.8,90,"Toxic Management & Unpaid Overtime","Manager expected 11 PM Teams replies and rejected my pre-approved medical PTO right before Diwali. Handed in my paper the next morning. Best decision I made this year.","Stopped doing unofficial weekend support, documented all project handovers over email, and prepared for interviews during morning hours.",75,!0,!1,!1,412,194,28,"2h ago",'10:45 PM on Teams: "Cancel your Diwali train ticket. Client wants the UAT deployment tested over the weekend."','10:48 PM: "I have submitted my formal resignation on the portal. My 90-day countdown starts tonight."',72)
B.Ko=new A.dK("3","Accenture","Senior Consultant",3.2,90,"Forced Return To Office & Relocation","Hired as permanent remote during 2023. Suddenly given a mandatory 14-day relocation notice to Bangalore or face termination. Team had 98% CSAT remotely.","Refused to sign the relocation agreement without compensation. Served the full 90 days remotely and used the time to lock in two competitive remote offers.",60,!0,!1,!1,298,142,14,"6h ago",'HR Broadcast: "Report to the Bangalore office within 14 days for 5-day badge tracking or face disciplinary separation."','Me: "My offer letter states Permanent Remote. Please process my 90-day notice period from home."',45)
B.Kp=new A.dK("5","Alphabet / Google","Staff Systems Engineer",4.5,60,"Global Restructuring & Cloud Realignment","Nine of us on our infrastructure pod were impacted without prior notice. We immediately connected on private channels, reviewed severance terms together, and secured medical benefits extension for 6 months.","Never sign the standard separation agreement on day 1. Review WARN Act protections, equity vest schedules, and band together with affected colleagues.",40,!0,!0,!0,640,310,22,"12h ago",'8:00 AM Automated Notification: "Your role in Core Systems has been impacted by structural alignment. SSO access suspended."','8:20 AM to Team Signal group: "United with 8 colleagues, retained counsel, and negotiated accelerated vesting before signing release."',60)
B.Kq=new A.dK("4","Cognizant","Data Analyst",2.1,90,"1.8% Appraisal after 14-hour days",'Three years of "next cycle for sure" ended with a 1.8% hike. I spent my notice period studying SQL LeetCode instead of fixing midnight pipeline bugs.',"Set strict boundaries. Handed over clear documentation every Friday and left the desk at 6 PM sharp.",85,!1,!1,!1,385,160,12,"8h ago",'Manager in 1-on-1: "Budget is tight this year so we gave you 1.8%, but we are promoting you in responsibility!"','Me: "Another company just promoted my compensation by +85%. Only 6 days of notice left!"',84)
B.Kr=new A.dK("6","Quick-Commerce Unicorn","Lead Growth Marketer",1.8,30,"Midnight Burnout & Phantom Equity Dilution","Endured 80-hour workweeks with the carrot of pre-IPO ESOPs. The latest funding round diluted common stock by 50% while workload doubled. Transitioned into a B2B SaaS with guaranteed cash comp.","Prioritize real cash in hand over unvested paper equity. During notice period, turn off work notifications after 6 PM and prep case studies.",65,!0,!1,!0,472,230,16,"1d ago",'11:45 PM Slack ping: "Why is GMV in Indiranagar down 3% today? Need a root cause slide deck before 2 AM."','11:55 PM: "Resignation submitted on Darwinbox. 30-day notice begins tomorrow; KT transition tracker shared."',18)
